      "review_description": "We were down sizing to a court yard house from our old traditional family home. Matthew was the salesperson who handled our original solar purchase and installation. Since our new house did not have solar, we searched the internet and spoke to various companies until we found that Matthew now had his own company. A quote and explanation of the panels to be used was enough to convince us. We now have a 4.12kw system and can't wait for summer to start pumping out the juice. Cannot recommend Matthew and his team high enough. Totally trustworthy and honest. Will not sell you a dud system.",
